,"sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-180d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"察觉到我似乎有话要问，\n姬子走进眼前的谈话室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1879","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1879"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她坐到沙发上，也让我坐下。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-18ee","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18ee"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「其实我啊，以前也担任过陪护喔」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-195b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-195b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「唉？…在这里？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-19ae","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-19ae"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「所以才认识的啦」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-19dd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-19dd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"真是意外。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a00","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a00"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我没办法把开朗的姬子，\n和陪护给我的印象结合在一起。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a6e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a6e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"至少，这7楼当陪护的人，\n总是给我稳重冷静的感觉。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1b10","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b10"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…不过…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1b25","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b25"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"仔细想想，也有可以肯定的部分。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1b62","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b62"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这7楼居住的病人，和其他楼层的病人不一样，\n被给予了一定的自由。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1bd8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1bd8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过，就算在这之中姬子也是最特别的。\n就好像是被允许做任何自己想做的事情。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c5e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c5e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"比如我之前就一直疑惑的，比如擅自在花坛种植花朵，\n还有不需要陪护的事情…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1cd6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1cd6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"莫名和医生护士的关系很好的事也能解释了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d21","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d21"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大概，是因为以前在这家医院担任过陪护的缘故吧，\n各种各样的事情都能够得到许可。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1df3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1df3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那个，能问你一件事吗？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e52","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e52"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…为什么会担任陪护？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e8b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e8b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这次我把疑问说了出来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1ec0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ec0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就算姬子曾经是陪护，\n不过，为什么会做这样的义工，无法想象出来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1f46","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f46"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"至少，自己所知道的姬子，\n感觉是和义工以及陪护这样的东西是无缘的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-1ffe","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ffe"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「因为是天主信徒的关系吧…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-205f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-205f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…天主信徒？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-20b2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-20b2"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，我的父母都是，\n　也会常常参加像是这样的公益活动」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2120","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2120"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这样的回答，让我更加意外。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2157","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2157"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然我自己本身，\n对于信徒和宗教相关的事情的一无所知。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-21bd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-21bd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过即使如此，比起刚才说的陪护，\n这与姬子给我的印象也还是相差得更远了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2255","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2255"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「而且你想一下，这是天主教的教会医院对吧？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-22c6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-22c6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…嗯，这我知道」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2321","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2321"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「所以…就更是如此了啊…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-234c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-234c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这种说法就好像这是所有问题的答案一样。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2393","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2393"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"的确，到现在为止都没怎么去注意过…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-23d4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-23d4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"正如她所说，像是教会的神父，\n修女之类的人也的确有看见来过。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-244c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-244c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过，对于我们这种普通的病人而言，\n平时也不会去关心医院的成分之类的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-24d0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24d0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"比起这个，大多还是因为外科的专家什么的，\n或是有名的内科医生在这里之类的理由才选择了这家医院的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-254e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-254e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过，对于在这里工作的人来说，\n似乎并不是这样的…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-25de","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-25de"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「不过，反正，我也只不过是个假信徒罢了」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-264b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-264b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…这样的吗？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-269c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-269c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，偶然，家住在教堂旁边而已」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-26e3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-26e3"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"姬子和平常一样开朗地回答着。\n那句话到底是真是假，我分辨不出来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-275d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-275d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"只是，她的视线却在那时移向了窗边，\n那看不太清的侧脸，像是在否定那句话的样子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-280f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-280f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「不过啊，没想到，\n　自己竟然也会住进7楼啊」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-289d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-289d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哈哈，果然，还是遭到了报应也说不一定呢」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-294d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-294d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"漫长的夏日天空，渐渐变暗的时候，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-29a0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-29a0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"爸爸难得的提前回家。\n今天的晚餐，凑齐了一家三人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2a08","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2a08"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从搬来这边后爸爸的上班路程变远了，\n这样三个人围绕在桌子上吃饭也是好久以前的事情了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2abb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2abb"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哦~，交到朋友了」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2b14","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2b14"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，所以最近才每天都出去呢」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2b60","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2b60"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「太好了呢，濑津美」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2bba","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2bba"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…嗯…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2bdd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2bdd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"听到我交到朋友，一起高兴着的爸爸。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2c26","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2c26"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"也会因为我最近身体状况不错，\n而更加地喜出望外吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2ca0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2ca0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…以前和爸爸一起，常常像这样三个人围着桌子共进晚餐。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2ced","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2ced"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过现在，因为晚归而只剩我和妈妈两个人。\n有时妈妈打工加班，我就一个人随随便便地吃了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2d83","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2d83"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…这就是我现在的日常生活。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2dd4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2dd4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从3年前的那天开始，反复出入医院的每一天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2e15","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2e15"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"姬子自己对自己说了，“遭报应”这句话。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2e66","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2e66"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那么我也，\n是因为做错了什么而遭到报应的吗…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2ece","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2ece"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"到底，我又是做错了什么了呢？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2f11","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2f11"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，受到的报应又是…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2f4a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2f4a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这样的我？　还是我的父母？\n又或者两者都是…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-2fd4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2fd4"},"allowed":["text","spea