ain","eventId":"mjo-3237"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"会得到赦免吗…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-3268","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3268"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"默然吃着土豆的我，据说这并非是温柔。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-32b5","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-32b5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"还有，不知为何如此亲近我的姬子。\n与父母之外的那些一直回避着我的人，截然相反。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-333d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-333d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"果然那个人也是…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07\",\"main\"]/mjo-336a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_07","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-336a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"因为没有其他人在，觉得很无聊吧…","speaker":"旁白"}}]}
